  "type": "html-template",
  "original": {
    "html": "<section\n  style=\"background-color:#0f0f1a; color:#e0e0e6; font-family:'Noto Sans SC', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; line-height:1.6; padding:0; margin:0; max-width:100%; overflow-x:hidden;\">\n\n  <section\n    style=\"position:relative; padding:30px 20px 50px; background:linear-gradient(135deg, #2c2c44 0%, #0f0f1a 100%); color:#ffffff;\">\n    <h1\n      style=\"font-size:2.4rem; font-weight:900; margin:0; line-height:1.2; letter-spacing:-0.5px; text-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\">\n      哔哩哔哩 | <span style=\"color:#7b68ee;\">《白银之城》</span></h1>\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; margin:10px 0 25px; color:#d0d0e8; letter-spacing:0.5px;\">\n      首曝PV+实机展示丨侦探的黄金时代</h2>\n\n    <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"80\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 80\" style=\"margin:15px 0;\">\n      <line x1=\"10\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#7b68ee\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,5\">\n        <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" from=\"100\" to=\"0\" dur=\"10s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" />\n      </line>\n      <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"40\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#7b68ee\">\n        <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0.3;1\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" />\n      </circle>\n      <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"40\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#7b68ee\">\n        <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"0.3;1;0.3\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" />\n      </circle>\n      <circle cx=\"350\" cy=\"40\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#7b68ee\">\n        <animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;0.3;1\" dur=\"3s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" />\n      </circle>\n    </svg>\n  </section>\n\n  <section\n    style=\"padding:30px 20px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:30px 30px 0 0; margin-top:-20px; box-shadow:0 -5px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\">\n    <h2\n      style=\"font-size:1.6rem; font-weight:800; color:#1a1a2e; margin:0 0 20px; position:relative; padding-left:15px; line-height:1.3;\">\n      <span style=\"position:relative; z-index:1;\">视觉符号解码</span>\n      <span\n        style=\"position:relative; display:block; font-size:1rem; color:#7b68ee; font-weight:600; margin-top:5px;\">PV中的蒸汽朋克美学盛宴</span>\n    </h2>\n\n    <p style=\"font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.8; color:#333344; margin-bottom:18px; letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      开场3秒的俯视镜头中，齿轮状城市布局暗喻着精密运转的社会机器。主角手持雨伞的剪影划过霓虹灯下的雨幕，这一经典黑色电影意象被赋予新的生命力——伞骨间流动的全息投影数据，完美诠释了<span\n        style=\"color:#7b68ee; font-weight:600;\">\"蒸汽朋克×近未来\"</span>的混搭美学。</p>\n\n    <p style=\"font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.8; color:#333344; margin-bottom:18px; letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      美术总监佐藤健一在采访中透露：\"UI设计灵感源自新艺术运动曲线，但交互逻辑采用量子计算机概念。\"实机演示里，维多利亚风格的机械键盘与悬浮触控面板同框出现，这种视觉碰撞正是当代玩家最追捧的<span\n        style=\"color:#7b68ee; font-weight:600;\">\"复古未来主义\"</span>。</p>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"background:#f2f0ff; padding:20px; border-radius:12px; margin:25px 0; border-left:4px solid #7b68ee;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:0.95rem; font-style:italic; color:#4a4a6a; margin:0;\">\n        <span style=\"font-weight:700;\">彩蛋提示：</span>2分13秒背景墙的通缉令上，隐藏着前作《黄铜迷宫》主角的剪影\n      </p>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"padding:35px 20px; background-color:#f8f8fc;\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:1.6rem; font-weight:800; color:#1a1a2e; margin:0 0 25px; position:relative; line-height:1.3;\">\n      <span style=\"position:relative; z-index:1;\">交互革命</span>\n      <span\n        style=\"position:relative; display:block; font-size:1rem; color:#7b68ee; font-weight:600; margin-top:5px;\">三维推理系统重塑侦探游戏</span>\n    </h2>\n\n    <p style=\"font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.7; color:#333344; margin-bottom:20px;\">核心玩法呈现三大突破：</p>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"background:#ffffff; border-radius:16px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:18px; box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(123,104,238,0.12);\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:1.05rem; margin:0 0 5px; font-weight:700; color:#1a1a2e;\">1. 立体现场勘察</p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:0.95rem; margin:0; color:#4a4a6a; line-height:1.6;\">通过Lumen全局光照技术，雨夜中的血迹反光角度会随玩家移动实时变化</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"background:#ffffff; border-radius:16px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:18px; box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(123,104,238,0.12);\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:1.05rem; margin:0 0 5px; font-weight:700; color:#1a1a2e;\">2. 动态线索网络</p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:0.95rem; margin:0; color:#4a4a6a; line-height:1.6;\">\n        NPC证言关联度以神经网络图谱可视化，说谎者会出现表情肌抽搐（基于Metahuman引擎）</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section\n      style=\"background:#ffffff; border-radius:16px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:25px; box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(123,104,238,0.12);\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:1.05rem; margin:0 0 5px; font-weight:700; color:#1a1a2e;\">3. 72小时破案机制</p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:0.95rem; margin:0; color:#4a4a6a; line-height:1.6;\">游戏内时间流逝会改变场景状态，错过关键时段将永久失去证据</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <p style=\"font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.8; color:#333344; letter-spacing:0.3px;\">特别值得关注的是<span\n        style=\"color:#7b68ee; font-weight:600;\">\"道德天平系统\"</span>——当玩家在\"法律程序\"与\"街头正义\"间做出选择时，整个城市的帮派势力版图都会产生连锁反应。制作组确认这会导致<span\n        style=\"color:#7b68ee; font-weight:600;\">37种截然不同的结局分支</span>。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"padding:35px 20px; background-color:#ffffff; position:relative;\">\n    <section\n      style=\"width:180px; height:180px; background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(123,104,238,0.15) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 70%); border-radius:50%; z-index:0; margin:-80px 0 0 auto;\">\n    </section>\n\n    <h2\n      style=\"font-size:1.6rem; font-weight:800; color:#1a1a2e; margin:0 0 25px; position:relative; line-height:1.3; z-index:1;\">\n      <span style=\"position:relative; z-index:1;\">技术标杆</span>\n      <span\n        style=\"position:relative; display:block; font-size:1rem; color:#7b68ee; font-weight:600; margin-top:5px;\">物理引擎如何服务叙事</span>\n    </h2>\n\n    <p style=\"font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.8; color:#333344; margin-bottom:20px; position:relative; z-index:1;\">\n      相比2023年TGA演示版本，最新实机展示了建筑可破坏系统的叙事价值：</p>\n\n    <section style=\"display:flex; margin-bottom:15px; align-items:center;\">\n      <section\n        style=\"width:8px; height:8px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#7b68ee; margin-right:12px; flex-shrink:0;\">\n      </section>\n      <p style=\"font-size:1rem; margin:0; color:#333344; line-height:1.6;\">子弹击碎玻璃的轨迹会永久保留在现场</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section style=\"display:flex; margin-bottom:15px; align-items:center;\">\n      <section\n        style=\"width:8px; height:8px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#7b68ee; margin-right:12px; flex-shrink:0;\">\n      </section>\n      <p style=\"font-size:1rem; margin:0; color:#333344; line-height:1.6;\">暴雨中的泥泞地面会保留NPC脚印随时间淡化的过程</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section style=\"display:flex; margin-bottom:25px; align-items:center;\">\n      <section\n        style=\"width:8px; height:8px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#7b68ee; margin-right:12px; flex-shrink:0;\">\n      </section>\n      <p style=\"font-size:1rem; margin:0; color:#333344; line-height:1.6;\">关键证物可以被故意破坏（但会影响案件评级）</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section style=\"background:#f2f0ff; border-radius:12px; padding:20px; margin:20px 0;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size:1.05rem; color:#333344; margin:0; line-height:1.7;\">\n        Epic中国区技术总监评价：\"这是首次看到Nanite技术被用于增强推理玩法——墙皮剥落程度能反映建筑年代，这本身就是重要线索。\"</p>\n    </section>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"padding:35px 20px; background-color:#f8f8fc;\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:1.6rem; font-weight:800; color:#1a1a2e; margin:0 0 20px; position:relative; line-height:1.3;\">\n      <span style=\"position:relative; z-index:1;\">侦探游戏的文艺复兴时代</span>\n    </h2>\n\n    <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/400/200?random=1\"\n      style=\"width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:16px; margin-bottom:25px; object-fit:cover; box-shadow:0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\"\n      alt=\"侦探游戏场景\">\n\n    <p style=\"font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.8; color:#333344; margin-bottom:20px; letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      从《逆转裁判》的法庭对峙到《极乐迪斯科》的意识流思辨，《白银之城》将开放世界与硬核推理结合的做法，标志着侦探游戏正迎来黄金时代。游戏史学专家李明指出：\"当玩家可以自由选择用黑客技术、暴力手段或传统侦查来破案时，我们实际上是在重新定义'侦探'这个职业。\"\n    </p>\n\n    <p style=\"font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.8; color:#333344; letter-spacing:0.3px;\">\n      随着AI对话系统与物理引擎的进步，未来侦探游戏很可能突破\"线索预设\"的局限，实现真正的涌现式叙事。而《白银之城》展示的，正是这个令人兴奋的未来图景。</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section style=\"padding:30px 20px; background-color:#1a1a2e; color:#ffffff;\">\n    <section style=\"background:#2a2a4a; border-radius:16px; padding:25px; margin-bottom:5px;\">\n      <p\n        style=\"font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:600; color:#d0d0e8; margin:0 0 15px; border-left:3px solid #7b68ee; padding-left:12px;\">\n        行业观察</p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:1rem; line-height:1.7; color:#c0c0d6; margin:0; letter-spacing:0.2px;\">\n        该作Steam愿望单新增量在PV发布24小时内暴涨<span\n          style=\"color:#7b68ee; font-weight:600;\">300%</span>，说明市场对创新性侦探题材的强烈需求。亚洲玩家特别关注游戏中东方街区的场景设计，这或许暗示着文化融合的新趋势。</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <svg width=\"100%\" height=\"60\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 60\" style=\"margin-top:20px;\">\n      <path d=\"M150,10 C70,10 30,50 10,50 L10,60 L290,60 L290,50 C270,50 230,10 150,10Z\" fill=\"#7b68ee\" opacity=\"0.2\">\n        <animate attributeName=\"d\"\n          values=\"M150,10 C70,10 30,50 10,50 L10,60 L290,60 L290,50 C270,50 230,10 150,10Z; M150,15 C70,15 30,45 10,45 L10,60 L290,60 L290,45 C270,45 230,15 150,15Z; M150,10 C70,10 30,50 10,50 L10,60 L290,60 L290,50 C270,50 230,10 150,10Z\"\n          dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" />\n      </path>\n    </svg>\n  </section>\n</section>"
  },
  "html": "<section style=\"padding: 24px; color: #292b2e; background-color: #fff\"><h1 style=\"font-size: 2.4rem; font-weight: 900; margin: 0; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.5px\">把阅读变成一次舒服的停留</h1><section><p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #333344; margin-bottom: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.3px\">文章的第一眼，决定读者愿不愿意停下来。好排版让观点先被看见，再让细节慢慢展开。</p><p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #333344; margin-bottom: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.3px\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1499951360447-b19be8fe80f5?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85\" alt=\"桌面上的阅读与写作\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 16px; margin-bottom: 25px\"/></p><h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 10px 0 25px; color: #d0d0e8; letter-spacing: 0.5px\">从标题开始，建立阅读节奏</h2><p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #333344; margin-bottom: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.3px\">标题需要一个清楚的重心。<strong>重点句只强调一次</strong>，其余正文让段落长度、行距和留白承担节奏。</p><blockquote><p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #333344; margin-bottom: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.3px\">排版的任务，是把内容的关系呈现出来。</p></blockquote><p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #333344; margin-bottom: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.3px\">每种风格都应该有自己的声音，同时让正文保持完整、清楚和可读。</p><h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 10px 0 25px; color: #d0d0e8; letter-spacing: 0.5px\">三个可以马上检查的地方</h2><ul><li>标题是否有独立的视觉重心</li><li>章节之间是否留出呼吸空间</li><li>重点是否与普通正文形成清楚层级</li></ul><p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #333344; margin-bottom: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.3px\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1455390582262-044cdead277a?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85\" alt=\"写作中的页面\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 16px; margin-bottom: 25px\"/></p><p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #333344; margin-bottom: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.3px\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1515378791036-0648a3ef77b2?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85\" alt=\"工作台上的笔记\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 16px; margin-bottom: 25px\"/></p><table><thead><tr><th>检查项</th><th>观察方式</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>标题</td><td>第一眼能否找到主题</td></tr><tr><td>正文</td><td>是否能够连续阅读</td></tr><tr><td>引用</td><td>是否与作者叙述区分</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #333344; margin-bottom: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.3px\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544947950-fa07a98d237f?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85\" alt=\"打开的杂志与页面\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 16px; margin-bottom: 25px\"/></p><h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 10px 0 25px; color: #d0d0e8; letter-spacing: 0.5px\">把风格落实到每一个细节</h2><p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #333344; margin-bottom: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.3px\">报纸用硬边栏线建立秩序，杂志用大留白放慢速度，信笺让段落像一次自然的交谈。</p><p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #333344; margin-bottom: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.3px\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1481627834876-b7833e8f5570?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1200&amp;q=85\" alt=\"阅读中的书页\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 16px; margin-bottom: 25px\"/></p><p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #333344; margin-bottom: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.3px\">一个完整的句子，不应该为了装饰被删掉。一张原有的表格，也不应该被换成没有事实来源的数字。</p><p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #333344; margin-bottom: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.3px\">读完之后，留下一个清楚的观点，比留下许多重复的色块更有价值。</p></section></section>",
  "layoutPrompt": "[cw-imported-style:{\"root\":\"padding:24px;color:#292b2e;background-color:#fff\",\"elements\":{\"h1\":\"font-size: 2.4rem; font-weight: 900; margin: 0; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.5px\",\"h2\":\"font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 10px 0 25px; color: #d0d0e8; letter-spacing: 0.5px\",\"p\":\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #333344; margin-bottom: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.3px\",\"img\":\"width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 16px; margin-bottom: 25px\",\"span\":\"color: #7b68ee\"}}]",
